# literal_translation = And tell how first the gods and Gaia came to be, and rivers and boundless sea, raging with a swell, and shining stars and wide Ouranos above [and the gods who came from them, givers of good things], and how they divided wealth and how they distributed honors, and also how first they held many-folded Olympus.

