# literal_translation = But hateful Eris bore indeed painful Ponos and Lethe and Limos and tearful Algea, Hysminai and Machai and Phonoi and Androktasiai, Neikea and false Logoi and Amphillogiai, and Dysnomia and Ate, accustomed to one another, and Horkos, who indeed harms earthly men most, whenever anyone willingly swears falsely.

