# literal_translation = And she bore in a hollow cave another resistless monster, in no way like mortal men nor immortal gods, divine stout-hearted Echidna, half indeed a quick-glancing, fair-cheeked nymph, and half again a monstrous serpent, terrible and great, writhing, raw-flesh-eating under the hiding-places of holy earth.

