# literal_translation = But when indeed she was about to bring forth Zeus, father of gods and also of men, then next she entreated her own dear parents, both Gaia and starry Ouranos, to devise a plan together, so that she might conceal giving birth to her dear child, and avenge the furies of her own father and of her children, whom great, wily Cronus swallowed down.

