# literal_translation = And as when in vaulted hives bees feed the drones, partners in evil deeds—who on the one hand all day long unto setting sun daily busy themselves and make white combs, while the drones on the other hand remaining within throughout the sheltered hives gather another's toil into their own belly—just so as an evil for mortal men high-thundering Zeus made women, partners in grievous deeds.

