# literal_translation = the one on the one hand will step down inside, and the other on the other hand goes out of doors, and never does the house hold both inside, but ever one at least being outside the house roams over the earth, while the other in turn being inside the house awaits the hour of her own journey, until it comes—the one on the one hand holding far-seeing light for dwellers on earth, and the other on the other hand carrying in her hands Sleep, the brother of Death.


