# literal_translation = for at one time they uttered so that gods might understand, at another time in turn the voice of a loud-roaring bull, unyielding in might, the voice of a proud beast, at another time in turn of a lion having a ruthless spirit, at another time in turn resembling whelps, a wonder to hear, at another time in turn he whistled, and the long mountains resounded underneath.

