# literal_translation = And he himself from his head [bore] bright-eyed Tritogeneia, dread, rouser of tumult, leader of hosts, Atrytone queen, whom din and wars and battles pleased; and Hera, not joined in love, bore glorious Hephaestus, and was wroth and quarreled with her husband, excelling all the Ouranions in craft.

