# literal_translation = And Hebe—the valiant son of beautiful-ankled Alcmene, the might of Heracles, completing groan-causing labors, the daughter of great Zeus and golden-sandaled Hera—he made his honored wife in snowy Olympus, blessed, who accomplishing a great deed among the immortals dwells unharmed and ageless for all days.

